    "summary": "For an **EMPEROR'S CHILDREN INFANTRY** model. In your opponent's Shooting phase, once per turn, right after an enemy unit shoots, you may:\n\n1. Pick one of your **EMPEROR'S CHILDREN** units no more than 9\" from the bearer and hit by at least one of those attacks.\n2. Pick a friendly **TRANSPORT** the unit can embark within, with the unit wholly within 6\" of it.\n3. Have the picked **EMPEROR'S CHILDREN** unit embark within the **TRANSPORT**.",
